# God Mode Upgrade Protocol

Multiple agents work on God Mode. Without coordination, new versions accidentally remove features other agents added. **Never just overwrite.**

## Before modifying `/opt/fpai/godmode-v3/`

1. **Validate your new version:**
   ```bash
   /opt/fpai/scripts/validate-godmode-upgrade.sh <your-new-server.py>
   ```
2. **If validation fails — MERGE, don't replace:**
   ```bash
   /opt/fpai/scripts/merge-godmode-versions.sh <your-new-server.py>
   ```
3. **Required features manifest:** `/opt/fpai/godmode-v3/REQUIRED_FEATURES.json`.

## v4.0 features that MUST be preserved

- Health Score Ring, Docker monitoring, Service logs
- Streaming Llama Chat, Browser notifications, Auto-refresh toggle
- Container health panel, Storage Sentinel, Intelligence Engine

If your upgrade drops any of these, validation will fail and you'll need to merge.

Related: `@docs/coordination/GODMODE_UPGRADE_PROTOCOL.md`.
